function_v0.doc:
One instance per underlying vault. `factory` decides which vaults may allocate;
`cap_authority` alone sets the protocol cap; `keeper` alone may call `harvest`;
`distributor` is Merkl's reward distributor (`None`: no claims); `withdrawal_period`
is the seconds the underlying takes to pay more than its idle cash (0: on demand).
`InvalidConfig` unless `underlying.query_asset() == asset`.
